        <field>Body__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">&lt;p&gt;Report Builder is the place to define a custom report — pick a dataset, choose fields, add filters, group, aggregate, and save. The result is a &lt;strong&gt;Report Definition&lt;/strong&gt; record that Report Viewer and Dashboard Builder can run.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The builder is JSON-backed: every step in the stepper edits a slice of the master &lt;code&gt;Definition_JSON__c&lt;/code&gt; field. Power users can switch to the &lt;strong&gt;Advanced&lt;/strong&gt; tab to edit raw JSON.&lt;/p&gt;</value>
    </values>
